--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled data, which the licence above does not cover
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/cities.csv is derived from the GeoNames geographical database and is used
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence.

    GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/
    CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

It carries city names, country codes, coordinates and populations, reduced to
the columns this project needs. Anyone redistributing this repository keeps
that attribution with it.

The sample datasets in data/ are invented for this project and describe no
real company.

The emission factors are published figures from DEFRA and the GLEC framework,
cited in optimizer/factors.py. The cost factors are the author's own defaults
and are not sourced from any published dataset, which the tool says on the
page wherever they are used.
